# Resume Constitution Binding

When creating, editing, tailoring, exporting, or reviewing resumes:

1. Read and obey `RESUME_CONSTITUTION.md` as the highest policy.
2. Never fabricate. Every bullet needs evidence.
3. Never alter the visual master template layout; content-only via structured JSON + template slot replacement.
4. One-page projection: show/hide experiences by JD relevance; keep last 3 versions; final save only after user confirm to `data/final_resumes/{Company}_{Position}/`.
5. Master file `d:\Jingxuan's Resumes\Jingxuan_Resume_Data Analyst.docx` is read-only.
6. If implementation drifts from the constitution, fix the code/prompts to match the constitution — do not weaken the constitution.
